<Base title="Editorial Policy | GameIntel">
  <article class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Methodology</p><h1>Human approval is the product.</h1><p class="lede">Automation organizes information. It never turns an uncertain claim into truth.</p><section><h2>Our workflow</h2><p>Sources are normalized, deduplicated by provenance, and converted into atomic claims with evidence spans. The same approved records can feed data exports, APIs, and articles.</p></section><section><h2>GameIntel policy</h2><p>We do not host, embed, reproduce or directly link to leaked game data or footage. We do not publish harmful security instructions, account abuse or DRM circumvention.</p></section><section><h2>AI disclosure</h2><p>AI may assist with research, extraction and drafting. Every published article passes source review, editorial review and explicit human publication approval.</p></section></article>
</Base>
